##  Context

Manually checking EC2 instances for health issues can take time, especially when managing multiple servers.

I built a simple automated monitoring solution that checks **EC2 instance health, CPU, memory, and disk usage** and sends **Slack alerts** when an issue is detected.

This helps identify problems faster without repeatedly checking each EC2 instance manually.
